{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2022-09-12 06:30:00', 'title': 'HENRY SCHEIN TO SHOWCASE DIVERSE PORTFOLIO OF PRODUCTS AT THE AAOMS ANNUAL CONFERENCE, SEPT. 12 – 17, 2022', 'text': "MELVILLE, N.Y.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HENRY SCHEIN, INC. (NASDAQ: HSIC) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS LINEUP OF PRODUCTS AND SOLUTIONS AT THE AMERICAN ASSOCIATION OF ORAL AND MAXILLOFACIAL SURGEONS (AAOMS) ANNUAL CONFERENCE IN NEW ORLEANS, LA. FROM SEPTEMBER 12 THROUGH SEPTEMBER 17. VISITORS AT HENRY SCHEIN'S BOOTH (#801) CAN EXPLORE THE COMPANY'S VAST SURGICAL PRODUCT OFFERINGS THAT HELP MEET THE UNIQUE NEEDS OF ORAL SURGEONS, AND ATTENDEES CAN SPEAK WITH HENRY SCHEIN DENTAL REPRESENTATIVES AS WELL AS HENRY"}